    Crew:
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.citadel
      Name: Oriel Vance
      Faction: 2
      Story: Reads a vault's shell like a face. Has opened more than she has kept.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.talon
      Name: Brisk Amadou
      Faction: 2
      Story: Tracks predators for a living, and sells what they guard.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.doe
      Name: Ilse Marren
      Faction: 12
      Story: Follows the grazers and writes down where they gather. Her notebooks are worth more than her hull.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.anvil
      Name: Teodor Haskel
      Faction: 10
      Story: Weighs every beam before he lays it. Has shored three breaches and lost none.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.needle
      Name: Pell
      Faction: 8
      Story: Finds the switch nobody else saw, and the ledger nobody else read.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.galleon
      Name: Cass Morrow
      Faction: 4
      Story: Knows every Ark by its silhouette, and every wreck by its smell.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.bandit
      Name: Juno Rask
      Faction: 5
      Story: Calls the rival out before the rival knows they are a rival. Collects on it after.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.hornet
      Name: Sable Okoye
      Faction: 7
      Story: Flies the burning edge of a pen for fun, and opens it for principle.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.flume
      Name: Aster Quill
      Faction: 6
      Story: Rides the tunnels others fear. Arrives early, leaves with a chart nobody had.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.volt
      Name: Merrin Tal
      Faction: 1
      Story: Prices news by its voltage. Fresh news sparks.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.zodiac
      Name: Dov Ferrante
      Faction: 11
      Story: Charts the fastest lane between any two ports, then races it for an audience.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.sundial
      Name: Noor Achebe
      Faction: 15
      Story: Keeps the hours of the slow tide. Has never once been late to a vigil.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.opal
      Name: Wren Holloway
      Faction: 16
      Story: Carries sealed accords between people who would rather shoot. Reads none of them. Probably.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.manger
      Name: Rook Sandoval
      Faction: 9
      Story: Knows where the herds will feed tomorrow, and harvests there today.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.ensign
      Name: Lady Corvina Ash
      Faction: 3
      Story: Holds what is hers. Considers most things hers.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.rampart
      Name: Marshal Edda Kroll
      Faction: 3
      Story: Has held Verdigris twice and lost it once. Remembers the once.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.wingman
      Name: Captain Theo Lark
      Faction: 14
      Story: Never leaves a wing behind. Never lets you forget it.
    - PilotId: pilot.callsign.ivy
      Name: Warden Sorrel
      Faction: 13
      Story: Tends the gardens of the nurseries, and would rather you did not shoot anything in them.
    Jobs:
    - Id: job.return
      Kind: 0
      Faction: 0
      Needs: 0
      Goes: 0
