    Seeds:
    - Port: loc.harbour.jade
      Tag: 1
      About: loc.lantern
      Line: A trader swears the shells at Lantern Reach are lit again.
    - Port: loc.harbour.ruby
      Tag: 3
      About: loc.verdigris
      Line: Verdigris is losing its core to the waves and asks for a squad.
    - Port: loc.harbour.gold
      Tag: 1
      About: loc.hollow
      Line: Something is glowing at the bottom of the Hollow.
    - Port: loc.tollmoor
      Tag: 2
      About: loc.saltmarch
      Line: An Ark went down at Saltmarch. Its hold spilled, and nobody has claimed it yet.
    - Port: loc.tollmoor
      Tag: 6
      About: loc.pale.anchorage
      Line: 'An old chart sold at Tollmoor names a place no lane runs to: the Pale Anchorage.'
    - Port: loc.gullbone
      Tag: 1
      About: loc.glassmere
      Line: Glassmere's shells are lit, say the crews who dare the thick water.
    - Port: loc.deepreed
      Tag: 4
      About: loc.spindrift
      Line: Spindrift Shallows is in bloom. The herds are already on their way up.
    SeedWrecks:
    - At: loc.saltmarch
      Artifacts:
      - artifact.hydra
      Line: A broken Ark at Saltmarch, its hold open to the sea.
    WreckLine: 'An Ark fell at {about}. What it carried lies there now.'
    WreckNewsLine: 'An Ark went down at {about} and its hold spilled. Nobody has claimed it yet.'
    Rivals:
    - Id: rival.black-tide
      Name: Black Tide
      Faction: 4
      Domain: 2
      Home: loc.gullbone
      Strength: 2
      Temper: 1
      Hulls:
      - Serpent
      - Sparrow
      - Squirrel
      Story: Three hulls and no flag. They take the roughest water because nobody follows them into it.
      ArriveLine: BLACK TIDE ARE HERE
      FallLine: 'Black Tide went down at {about}.'
      WinLine: 'Black Tide cracked a shell at {to} before you reached it.'
    - Id: rival.rusted-grin
      Name: The Rusted Grin
      Faction: 4
      Domain: 2
      Home: loc.gullbone
      Strength: 3
      Temper: 2
      Hulls:
      - Dolphin
      - Serpent
      - Rhino
      Story: The best crew out of Gullbone, and they know it. They go where the pay is and leave nothing behind.
      ArriveLine: THE RUSTED GRIN ARE HERE
      FallLine: 'The Rusted Grin went down at {about}. Gullbone will not believe it.'
      WinLine: 'The Rusted Grin opened a shell at {to} while you were still on the lane.'
    - Id: rival.longwake
      Name: Longwake Lodge
      Faction: 2
      Domain: 2
      Home: loc.tollmoor
      Strength: 2
      Temper: 0
      Hulls:
      - Squirrel
      - Sparrow
      - Manta
      Story: Old hunters who take the near work and come home every time. They have opened more vaults than anyone living.
      ArriveLine: LONGWAKE LODGE ARE HERE
      FallLine: 'Longwake Lodge went down at {about}.'
      WinLine: 'Longwake Lodge opened a vault at {to} first.'
    - Id: rival.quiet-spear
      Name: The Quiet Spear
      Faction: 2
      Domain: 2
      Home: loc.deepreed
      Strength: 1
      Temper: 1
      Hulls:
      - Sparrow
      - Sparrow
      - Dolphin
      Story: Young, loud, and after the predators nobody else will hunt. They lose more hulls than they keep.
      ArriveLine: THE QUIET SPEAR ARE HERE
      FallLine: 'The Quiet Spear went down at {about}, as everyone said they would.'
      WinLine: 'The Quiet Spear got to the shells at {to} ahead of you.'
    - Id: rival.brass-lantern
      Name: Brass Lantern Company
      Faction: 1
      Domain: 4
      Home: loc.tollmoor
      Strength: 2
      Temper: 0
      Hulls:
      - Rhino
      - Manta
      - Dolphin
      Story: Couriers on a schedule. Half the news on the sea rides in their hold, and they charge for every word.
      ArriveLine: BRASS LANTERN COMPANY ARE HERE
      FallLine: 'A Brass Lantern Ark went down at {about}. The schedule will be kept anyway.'
      WinLine: 'Brass Lantern Company took the find at {to} first.'
    - Id: rival.writ-and-hook
      Name: Writ and Hook
      Faction: 5
      Domain: 4
      Home: loc.tollmoor
      Strength: 2
      Temper: 2
      Hulls:
      - Sparrow
      - Squirrel
      - Serpent
      Story: They serve warrants for whoever pays, and read every bounty board on the sea. If there is a price on you, they know it.
      ArriveLine: WRIT AND HOOK ARE HERE
      FallLine: 'Writ and Hook went down at {about}. Someone collected on them for once.'
      WinLine: 'Writ and Hook took the find at {to} ahead of you.'
    - Id: rival.house-verdance
      Name: House Verdance
      Faction: 3
      Domain: 1
      Home: loc.deepreed
      Strength: 2
      Temper: 0
      Hulls:
      - Rhino
      - Manta
      - Scarab
      Story: A house that holds cores and keeps them. Slow, heavy and never surprised.
      ArriveLine: HOUSE VERDANCE ARE HERE
      FallLine: 'A House Verdance Ark went down at {about}. The house will send another.'
      WinLine: 'House Verdance claimed the find at {to} before you.'
    - Id: rival.far-shoal
      Name: Far Shoal Society
      Faction: 6
      Domain: 2
      Home: loc.gullbone
      Strength: 1
      Temper: 1
      Hulls:
      - Manta
      - Squirrel
      - Dolphin
      Story: They want to be first everywhere and are, often enough. A place they charted first pays you half.
      ArriveLine: FAR SHOAL SOCIETY ARE HERE
      FallLine: 'Far Shoal Society went down at {about}, somewhere nobody had charted.'
      WinLine: 'Far Shoal Society reached the shells at {to} first.'
    - Id: rival.driftnet
      Name: Driftnet Cooperative
      Faction: 9
      Domain: 4
      Home: loc.deepreed
      Strength: 1
      Temper: 0
      Hulls:
      - Manta
      - Manta
      - Rhino
      Story: Harvesters who follow the blooms and sell the crystal at Deepreed. Harmless, unless you wanted the bloom.
      ArriveLine: DRIFTNET COOPERATIVE ARE HERE
      FallLine: 'A Driftnet Ark went down at {about}.'
      WinLine: 'Driftnet Cooperative skimmed the bloom at {to} before you.'
    Sagas:
    - Id: saga.lantern
      Name: The Lantern Keeper
      StartPort: 
      StartTier: 0
      StartDay: 0
      Relic:
        Kind: artifact.hydra
        Name: Lantern of Oriel
        Lore: The keeper of Lantern Reach sealed half her chart in a vault and carried the other half to her rest. Whoever joins them lights the lantern, and the lantern splits whatever it touches three ways.
        Seed: lantern-of-oriel
      Chapters:
      - Id: ch.lantern.1
        Faction: 2
        Tier: 0
        Job: job.hunt.sighting
        At: loc.lantern
        AtExperience: 0
        Line: 'The oldest shell at {about} is said to hold half a chart. A hunter could open it.'
        Opens: ch.lantern.2
        DoneLine: 'Half a chart came out of the vault at {to}. The other half is wherever the keeper rested.'
      - Id: ch.lantern.2
        Faction: 6
        Tier: 0
        Job: job.survey.fragment
        At: loc.keepers.rest
        AtExperience: 0
        Line: 'The half chart points off the edge of the sea to {about}. An explorer could follow it.'
        Opens: ch.lantern.3
        DoneLine: '{to} is on the chart. The keeper''s beacon stands there, unlit.'
      - Id: ch.lantern.3
        Faction: 15
        Tier: 1
        Job: job.vigil.shrine
        At: loc.keepers.rest
        AtExperience: 0
        Line: 'The keeper''s beacon at {about} wants a vigil to light it. A priest the shrines trust could keep it.'
        Opens: 
        DoneLine: 'The vigil at {to} lit the keeper''s lantern. The {relic} is aboard.'
    - Id: saga.accord
      Name: The Salt Accord
      StartPort: loc.tollmoor
      StartTier: 0
      StartDay: 2
      Relic:
        Kind: artifact.aegis
        Name: Seal of Still Water
        Lore: The seal the Court of Still Water set on the Salt Accord, the truce that let the trade lane open. Set on an Ark it shields the hull as it shielded the lane.
        Seed: seal-of-still-water
      Chapters:
      - Id: ch.accord.1
        Faction: 1
        Tier: 0
        Job: job.courier.dispatch
        At: loc.gullbone
        AtExperience: 0
        Line: 'Tollmoor wants the first word of a truce carried to {about}. A merchant''s dispatch would do it.'
        Opens: ch.accord.2
        DoneLine: 'The word of the truce reached {to}. Now someone has to carry the accord itself.'
      - Id: ch.accord.2
        Faction: 16
        Tier: 0
        Job: job.parley.accord
        At: loc.gullbone
        AtExperience: 0
        Line: 'The Salt Accord is drafted. A diplomat could carry it to the crews at {about} and have it signed.'
        Opens: ch.accord.3
        DoneLine: 'The Salt Accord was signed at {to}. The lane is open if someone holds it.'
      - Id: ch.accord.3
        Faction: 3
        Tier: 1
        Job: job.defence.patrol
        At: loc.saltmarch
        AtExperience: 0
        Line: 'The accord holds only while {about} is held. An aristocrat the court trusts could hold it.'
        Opens: 
        DoneLine: '{to} was held while the accord took. The court sent its seal: the {relic} is aboard.'
    - Id: saga.tide
      Name: The Tide That Remembers
      StartPort: loc.deepreed
      StartTier: 0
      StartDay: 1
      Relic:
        Kind: artifact.aftershock
        Name: Memory of the Reef
        Lore: A crystal from the first bloom of the Nursery of Verdigris, kept at the Deepreed Shrine. It remembers where it struck, and strikes there again.
        Seed: memory-of-the-reef
      Chapters:
      - Id: ch.tide.1
        Faction: 12
        Tier: 0
        Job: job.study.bloom
        At: loc.verdigris.nursery
        AtExperience: 0
        Line: 'The wardens of Deepreed want the bloom at {about} studied before it is gathered. A researcher could watch it feed.'
        Opens: ch.tide.2
        DoneLine: 'The bloom at {to} was studied. The wardens want it tended through the next one.'
      - Id: ch.tide.2
        Faction: 13
        Tier: 0
        Job: job.tend.nursery
        At: loc.verdigris.nursery
        AtExperience: 0
        Line: 'The nursery at {about} must come through a bloom with nothing killed. A preservationist could tend it.'
        Opens: ch.tide.3
        DoneLine: '{to} came through its bloom untouched. Its first crystals are promised to the shrine.'
      - Id: ch.tide.3
        Faction: 9
        Tier: 1
        Job: job.harvest.bloom
        At: loc.shrine.deepreed
        AtExperience: 0
        Line: 'The first crystals of the bloom are to be gathered at {about}, under the shrine. A gatherer the wardens trust could bring them in.'
        Opens: 
        DoneLine: 'The first crystals were gathered at {to}. The shrine gave up what it kept: the {relic} is aboard.'
    - Id: saga.grin
      Name: The Grin's Tooth
      StartPort: loc.gullbone
      StartTier: 0
      StartDay: 3
      Relic:
        Kind: artifact.javelin
        Name: Grin's Tooth
        Lore: The javelin the Rusted Grin's first captain threw through three hulls at once. Lost with their first Ark, hoarded by thieves, hunted ever since.
        Seed: grins-tooth
      Chapters:
      - Id: ch.grin.1
        Faction: 4
        Tier: 0
        Job: job.raid.hoard
        At: loc.magpie
        AtExperience: 0
        Line: 'The thieves of {about} hold the chart to the Grin''s first wreck. A pirate could take it out of their hoard.'
        Opens: ch.grin.2
        DoneLine: 'The chart came out of the hoard at {to}. It is in a cipher only Gullbone''s ledgers can read.'
      - Id: ch.grin.2
        Faction: 8
        Tier: 0
        Job: job.lift.dispatch
        At: loc.gullbone
        AtExperience: 0
        Line: 'The cipher key sits in the ledgers at {about}. A thief could lift it.'
        Opens: ch.grin.3
        DoneLine: 'The key came out of {to}. The chart reads: Cinder Shoal, in the lair.'
      - Id: ch.grin.3
        Faction: 2
        Tier: 1
        Job: job.hunt.lair
        At: loc.cinder.shoal
        AtExperience: 0
        Line: 'The Grin''s first wreck lies in the lair at {about}, and the lair is awake. A hunter the lodges trust could clear it.'
        Opens: 
        DoneLine: 'The lair at {to} was cleared and the first wreck found. The {relic} is aboard.'
